GLASSCAGE has zero runtime dependencies (Python standard library only). Optional
features use the following third-party packages only when their extras are installed;
each is distributed under its own license by its respective authors:

  - cryptography  (Apache-2.0 / BSD)      enables --encrypt-evidence
  - anthropic     (MIT)                   enables the optional LLM-as-judge (--judge)
  - pyyaml        (MIT)                   enables YAML configuration files
  - rich          (MIT)                   enables prettier CLI output

These packages are NOT bundled with GLASSCAGE and are not required for core operation.
